6.  MUTATION CONTROLS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  MUTATION: kernel off (nu = 1) -- must break the agreement  [canonical footing, x_ta = 0.7175]
    group         M_b [Msun]   R_0 obs  R_0 pred     dex    M_T/M_b obs
