7.  WHAT THE CANDIDATE COSTS: the error budget on the coefficient
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    external field nu(e_N), no-cluster vs max-cluster : 0.153 dex on R_0
    footing, a_0 canonical vs alt (enters as H_Lam^-2/3): 0.055 dex
    Upsilon_K to 25%                                   : 0.028 dex
    R_0 measurement, mean bootstrap width              : 1.353 dex
    => the systematic floor on the COEFFICIENT alone is 0.164 dex, which already exceeds the 0.100 dex the criterion asks of the whole relation.

